Lunduke's Linux Kernel (lunduke-linux-kernel)
=============================================

Metapackage for linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (ABI lcos14). Recommends matching
headers.

LCOS 0.8 ISOs shipped 7.2.6-lcos12 (that config stays frozen). lcos13
stays frozen. This metapackage is the lcos14 revision of the same
7.2.6-lunduke image name. On older LCOS releases that still ship a
Distro/Devuan kernel, install from the apt overlay, reboot, and pick
7.2.6-lunduke in GRUB (or set it once).

  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install lunduke-linux-kernel

Apt overlay: https://lcos.lunduke.com/apt

lcos14: snd-intel8x0 (CONFIG_SND_INTEL8X0=m, Intel 82801AA AC97,
PCI 8086:2415, LCOS#94) and mt76x0e (CONFIG_MT76x0E=m, MediaTek
MT7610E/MT7630E/MT7650E, PCI 14c3:7630, LCOS#95).
CONFIG_SND_INTEL8X0M and CONFIG_MT76x0U stay unset.
No Forced Rust. No firmware blob. lcos12 and lcos13 stay frozen.
